    "topic": "Online:",
    "speaker_line": "Kevin O’Connor",
    "text": "Manhattan resident. Disappointed that the east side improvements on Canal Street are delayed. Good friend Kevin Cruickshank and Mae Kwan were killed by a car that was speeding coming off the Manhattan Bridge. Dangers to pedestrians on Canal Street are not theoretical. Don’t let the perfect be the enemy of the good. Too many lives have already been lost on Canal Street.",
